### =========================
### DISCUSSION
### =========================

### Create Discussion
POST http://localhost:8081/discussions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Question",
  "content": "How does @Transactional work?",
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 1
}

###

### Get All Discussions
GET http://localhost:8081/discussions

###

### Get Discussion By ID
GET http://localhost:8081/discussions/1

###

### Get Discussions For Course
GET http://localhost:8081/discussions/course/1

###

### Update Discussion
PUT http://localhost:8081/discussions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Spring Question",
  "content": "What is the difference between REQUIRED and REQUIRES_NEW?",
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 1
}


### =========================
### VALIDATION TESTS
### =========================

### Invalid Student - Should Return 400
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### returns 500

### Invalid Teacher - Should Return 400
POST http://localhost:8081/teachers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "wrong"
}

###returns 500

### Invalid Course - Should Return 400
POST http://localhost:8081/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "teacherId": null
}

###

### Invalid Enrollment - Should Return 400
POST http://localhost:8081/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": null,
  "courseId": null
}

###sends 400 withmessage

### Invalid Discussion - Should Return 400
POST http://localhost:8081/discussions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": "",
  "studentId": null,
  "courseId": null
}
### gets 400 

